    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No.39 Rathmore Village is located in the development of Tyrrelstown which is approx. 8 miles from Central Dublin, south of the old Hollystown Golf course, set between the Navan and the Ashbourne Road, and within 2 miles of the Blanchardstown Centre. The development is close to all amenities the Blanchardstown centre has to offer, and has the added benefit of being located within walking distance of The new Tyrrelstown Town Centre which include retailers such as Supervalu Lidl, Paddy Power, Joanne Creighton Hair Group,  Hickeys Pharmacy and a variety of restaurants & Cafes.\r\n \r\n_________________________________________________________________\r\nNo 39 Rathmore Village is a 4 bed mid terrace three storey house presented in excellent condition throughout. Some of the special features afforded to this property are four double bedrooms, walk in condition, bright and airy, south facing rear garden, car parking for two cars & within minutes walking distance of the Tyrrelstown Town Centre. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nNo.39 Rathmore Village is located in the development of Tyrrelstown which is approx. 8 miles from Central Dublin, south of the old Hollystown Golf course, set between the Navan and the Ashbourne Road, and within 2 miles of the Blanchardstown Centre. The development is close to all amenities the Blanchardstown centre has to offer, and has the added benefit of being located within walking distance of the Tyrrelstown Town Centre which include retailers such as brand new Tesco store, Supervalu, Lidl, Paddy Power, Joanne Creighton Hair Group,  Hickeys Pharmacy and a variety of restaurants & Cafes.\r\n \r\n_________________________________________________________________\r\nNo 39 Rathmore Village is a super 4 bed mid terrace three storey house presented in excellent condition throughout. \r\nSome of the special features afforded to this property are four double bedrooms, walk in condition, bright and airy, south facing low maintenance, rear garden, car parking for two cars & within minutes walking distance of the Tyrrelstown Town Centre.\r\nIt is the ideal family home, with its spacious bedrooms, and open plan living area.\r\n\r\nThe 40D bus provides a regular and convenient link to Dublin City Centre.\r\n\r\n\r\nViewing is highly advised."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation\r\n_____________________________________________________\r\nEntrance Hallway: - (c5.36 mtrs x c1.96mtrs) – Ceramic tiles  \r\n\r\nGuest w.c – c1.65mtrs x c0.76 mtrs – Tiled floor, w.h.b with tiled splash w.c. \r\n\r\nKitchen – (c2.50m x c 4.85m) Ceramic tiled floor, fully fitted white high gloss kitchen, tiled splash back, dishwasher, washing machine, ceramic hob, Electric oven, fridge freezer, microwave \r\n\r\n Living /dining room c.5.43 mtrs x c3.36 mtrs – Ceramic tiled floor, French doors leading to southerly rear garden. \r\nStairs & first Landing: - Carpeted \r\nFirst floor:\r\n Bedroom 1 (c 2.75m x c4.51x c3.77 mtrs – Spacious bright room, carpeted, large bright window to ground level \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 c. (3.31 mtrs x 3.30 mtrs) Carpeted & Fitted wardrobes \r\n\r\nToilet (c 1.04m x c 2.08m) wc, whb, lino flooring, bath, whb, wc, tiled splashback \r\n\r\nStairs & Second Landing: - Carpeted\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom c. 2.49 mtrs x 1.94mtrs – bath, tiled splashback, shower attachment, w.c & w.h.b, lino flooring \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 c.3.33 mtrs x 2.46 mtrs –carpeted, Fitted wardrobes.  \r\n\r\nEn suite c 0.99 mtrs x 2.69 mtrs – Tiled splashback w.c, w.h.b, and shower cubicle with shower door\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 c.2.28 mtrs x 3.50 mtrs–Carpeted & Fitted wardrobes. \r\n\r\nBedroom 4 c.2.30 mtrs x c.3.78 mtrs–Carpeted & Fitted wardrobes. \r\n\r\nRear garden –Large South facing rear garden with barna shed with side and rear access to two allocated parking spaces"
      },
